# Example: point FlightSim MemoryBox smoke/ingest at media-server Sources (D7)
# Copy values into your session or a gitignored env file. Do not commit secrets or private path variants beyond this template.

# Canonical UNC (prefer this on FlightSim):
MEMORYBOX_SOURCES_ROOT=\\media-server\photos\MemoryBox\Sources
MEMORYBOX_SMOKE_MBOX_URI=\\media-server\photos\MemoryBox\Sources\email\All mail Including Spam and Trash-002.mbox
MEMORYBOX_SMOKE_ICS_URI=\\media-server\photos\MemoryBox\Sources\calendar\ics\swill01@gmail.com.ics
MEMORYBOX_SMOKE_LIMIT=5

# SMS export is staged for later P1 communications work (not ingested in I3):
# \\media-server\photos\MemoryBox\Sources\sms\Messages - 1085 chat sessions.csv

# Mapped-drive equivalent when P: -> \\media-server\photos:
# MEMORYBOX_SMOKE_MBOX_URI=P:\MemoryBox\Sources\email\All mail Including Spam and Trash-002.mbox
# MEMORYBOX_SMOKE_ICS_URI=P:\MemoryBox\Sources\calendar\ics\swill01@gmail.com.ics
